{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Woodworm is a grid-based puzzle game about carving bite-sized wooden sculptures. After being magically transformed into a tiny wood-eating grub, your workshop seems so much bigger - and your job will be much more challenging!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404590/extras/ad266e38cce9cb3e47ab06f1ed1bed9e.poster.avif?t=1764985187\" width=480 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404590/extras/ad266e38cce9cb3e47ab06f1ed1bed9e.webm?t=1764985187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404590/extras/ad266e38cce9cb3e47ab06f1ed1bed9e.mp4?t=1764985187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each puzzle, you must create a specific shape by eating away sections of the wood. You will need to experiment and plan ahead to learn the intricacies of woodcarving and complete each sculpture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is an expansion and re-imagining of the original PICO-8 hit WOODWORM - with updated visuals, sound, and even more puzzles!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive, easy-to-learn controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles ranging from simple to surprisingly difficult</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heaps of shapes to carve and tricks to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New wood types with new rules and interactions</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller and Steam Deck support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackg