ood. You will need to experiment and plan ahead to learn the intricacies of woodcarving and complete each sculpture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is an expansion and re-imagining of the original PICO-8 hit WOODWORM - with updated visuals, sound, and even more puzzles!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive, easy-to-learn controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles ranging from simple to surprisingly difficult</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heaps of shapes to carve and tricks to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New wood types with new rules and interactions</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller and Steam Deck support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Samuel Pratt"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404590/c86480761ccca2612f9581ea86191151cc8efba4/header.jpg?t=1764985187","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3404590/531703309/525eefb6cd9f7a25af929b16c3254be860ae7464/1764984694/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764985186","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3404590/531703309/525eefb6cd9f7a25af929b16c3254be860ae7464/1764984694/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764985186","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3404590/531703309/525eefb6cd9f7a25af929b16c3254be860ae7464/1764984694/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764985186","id":257244279,"name":"Coming Soon Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257244279/d21a7b6c8811aa925bd833839e98843edf4e907a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764985186"}],"name":"Woodworm","package_groups":[],"pc_re